# Severity Vocabulary

## Summary
The single definition of severity that the Severity field and the Severity Badge both read: `SEVERITY_LEVELS` (minor, major, critical), `SEVERITY_RANK` (1–3), `SEVERITY_LABELS`, `SEVERITY_HUE` (amber, orange, red) and `certificateAtRisk(level)`, true for major and above. It lives apart from both so each can import it without importing the other.

## Usage
```ts
import {
  SEVERITY_HUE,
  certificateAtRisk,
} from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/severity/severity-vocabulary';

let hue = SEVERITY_HUE[finding.severity.level];
```

## Non-goals
No field and no component: those are the Severity field and the Severity Badge.
